# Set the full 6x6 stiffness matrix for the compliance controller.
#
# The matrix is given in row-major order with axes ordered as
# [trans_x, trans_y, trans_z, rot_x, rot_y, rot_z].
#
# This service allows setting a fully-coupled (non-diagonal) stiffness matrix,
# which is not possible through dynamic_reconfigure (diagonal-only). Note that
# a subsequent dynamic_reconfigure update will overwrite it with a diagonal one.

# Full 6x6 stiffness matrix [N/m for translation, Nm/rad for rotation], row-major
float64[36] stiffness

---

bool success
string message
